  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Red Soil CZ: From natural to anthropogenic evolution of Red Soil and its impact on ecosystem function in the Critical Zone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poor management of land and water is contributing to food and water insecurity in China. Funding will support enhanced system surveys and monitoring in Critical Zones to enhance understanding of soil and water systems in China and inform sustainable management of their soil and water systems</narrative>
  </description>
